Service Statistics [Broker]
To open the service statistics table, which shows the Dwelling Time and the Mediation Time per service,
click this button.
Remarks
Note
If a service is fulfilled by several Workers or Exporters/Workers, Plant Simulation records this time interval
only once. The same applies for the count. For the time during which the Worker was en-route to his
job, statistics counts the time of the Worker who was en-route the longest.
