Open Importers [Broker]
Opens a table, which shows all objects whose importers registered an unsatisfied request with the Broker.
Remarks
The table shows the Importers in column 1, and their Type in column 2: The number 0 designates the
failure-importer, 1 the set-up-importer, 2 the processing-importer, and 3 the transport-importer.
An Importer, who is interrupted because another station with a higher priority requires the resource, is
sorted at the first place in the list.
See also
getOpenImporters [SimTalk]
forgetOpenRequest [SimTalk]
Open Importers [Broker]
